# --- DEEP 10-24 (one-hour pass: a climb, a dive, more to find; RAFT_ISLAND_DESIGN 0b): the west crag and Expedition 3's mast (climb, zipline to the ramp foot), the expedition boat off the south-east (dive), the expedition strongbox, the north-east knoll
# the climb (optional, STORY 10-24: no tower, no zipline): the trail winds up the west crag to Expedition 3's snapped mast and box
call vd_mount x=-65 z=0 top=24 r=14 a0=90 turns=1.25 hb=3
place RT_Pillar rcmast at -65 0 h=24 sit sy=0.8
prop rcmast tint.color=#5a4a32
prop rcmast tint.amount=0.5
place Loot_ChestSmall rcbox at -63.4 -1.4 h=24 sit yaw=90
prop rcbox loot.refill=0
place Placeable_Flag_05 - at -66.4 1.4 h=24 sit
call vd_spot x=-65 z=1.5 al=rctopz id=rc_top r=4 msg="Expedition 3's mast on the crag, snapped off at head height. The dome's hill lies below you like a sleeping animal."
note rcbox Expedition mast box | EXPEDITION 3 - MAST. The mast came down in the first storm. Strongbox at the expedition camp, key with the boat. Walk down the way you came; there is no line off this crag any more.
loot rcbox Rope*3;Bolt*2;Battery*1
# the dive: BoatStranded on the sea floor 12 m down, its crate, an air pocket
call vd_dive x=60 z=-90 h=-12 yaw=40 obj="BoatStranded" al=rcwreck crate=rccrate zal=rcwz zid=rc_wreck msg="Expedition 3's boat, on the bottom off the south-east point. The skipper's drawer is still shut." air=rcair bub=rcbub
note rccrate Skipper's drawer | A strongbox key on a brass ring, tagged EXP 3 - EAST CAMP.
loot rccrate story:expkey*1;Scrap*3;Bolt*2
# Expedition 3's east camp: a tent, a cold fire, the strongbox (its key went down with the boat) and its log
clear at 60 -40 r=6
brush flatten at 60 -40 r=5 s=20 frames=150
place Balboa_DecorationPrefabBase_SimpleTent - at 57 -37 ground sit yaw=140
place campfire_1 - at 61 -37.5 ground sit
place "Box Big" expbox at 62 -42 ground sit yaw=300
place Loot_ChestSmall expchest at 60 -43 ground sit yaw=300
# the north-east knoll (secret): a low hill with a lookout box
call vd_mount x=60 z=60 top=14 r=12 a0=220 turns=1 n=30 hb=3
place Loot_ChestSmall rcknoll at 60 60 h=14 sit yaw=220
note rcknoll Knoll lookout box | A lookout's box: a spyglass with a cracked lens. Scratched inside: SHE CAME OUT OF THE DOME AT NIGHT.
loot rcknoll Rope*2;Leather*2;Coconut*2
prop rcknoll loot.refill=0
call vd_spot x=60 z=61.5 al=rcknollz id=rc_knoll r=3 msg="From the knoll the dome's hill steams in the morning sun."
place Creature_Chicken rchens at 30 -60 ground
prop rchens creature.count=3

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=The Rootcore
info author=Custom Islands
info description=The rock under the Heart: Raft's bear cave become the dome of the Rootcore, the organism round the oldest root, the Ringwave cut into it, and the Blightmother on guard. The finale of The Last Green World, part 2.
island on.arrive=message||A rock out of the sea, warm to the touch. In its side, a cave mouth breathing green air.

story core|Core finished|Note_Paper|The Rootcore, finished the way the Heart was set.
story shard|Heart shard|Note_Paper|A shard of the oldest root, green and warm. The brood tore three of them off and carried them away.
story rootlit|Root awake|Note_Paper|The three shards are back in the oldest root. The valves have pressure.
story heartseed|Heart seed|Note_Paper|A seed from the oldest root, hard as a stone and warm. The last of the Heart.

prop blightmother obj.name=blightmother
prop blightmother creature.count=1
prop blightmother creature.respawn=0
prop blightmother creature.zone=dome
prop blightmother creature.size=1.5
prop blightmother creature.health=10
prop blightmother creature.damage=1.5
prop blightmother boss.phase=0.5
prop firebasket1 obj.name=firebasket1
prop firebasket1 beh.use=Tip the fire basket onto the growth
prop firebasket1 if.use=!signal|basket1
prop firebasket1 on.use=signal||basket1\nhit|blightmother|25\nmessage||Burning coals spill over the Blightmother. She screams and the growth on her back shrivels.
prop firebasket2 obj.name=firebasket2
prop firebasket2 beh.use=Tip the fire basket onto the growth
prop firebasket2 if.use=!signal|basket2
prop firebasket2 on.use=signal||basket2\nhit|blightmother|25\nmessage||Burning coals spill over the Blightmother. She screams and the growth on her back shrivels.
prop blightmother boss.summon=3
prop blightmother boss.summonKind=Creature_Boar
prop blightmother tint.color=#8a3ac0
prop blightmother tint.amount=0.6
prop blightmother on.defeat=signal||mother\nmessage||The Blightmother falls. Behind her, the oldest root - and something cut into it.
prop brood creature.count=3
prop brood creature.respawn=0
prop brood tint.color=#8a3ac0
prop brood tint.amount=0.45
prop oldroot tint.color=#4a3424
prop oldroot tint.amount=0.5
prop oldroot obj.name=oldroot
prop oldroot beh.use=Set the heart shards into the oldest root
prop oldroot if.use=take|story:shard|3
prop oldroot on.use=give||story:rootlit*1\nplaysound||event:/exploring/radar/radar_humm|0.8|once|near\ncollapse|teodorwall|4\nshow|teodortape\ncamera|domecam|oldroot|6|40\nmessage||The shards slide into the torn wood and hold. A hum runs down the root - and the coral wall behind it shakes, cracks and falls away. Behind it, on a box: a tape recorder, its red light still on.
prop oldroot else.use=message||Three shards are torn out of the root. The brood carried them off - one in the dome, one by the wreck, one behind the vines.
prop rangercache obj.name=rangercache
prop rangercache beh.hidden=1
loot rangercache TitaniumIngot*2;Battery*1;Rope*3
prop rangercache loot.refill=0
note rangercache Oda's locker | Oda's last locker: two titanium ingots, a battery and rope. A tag: FOR WHOEVER GOES IN.
prop rangerlock obj.name=rangerlock
prop rangerlock beh.use=Open Oda's locker
prop rangerlock if.use=has|story:rangerkey
prop rangerlock on.use=hide|\nshow|rangercache\nmessage||Oda's key fits her last locker.
prop rangerlock else.use=message||A locker stencilled RANGER - O. FENN. Her key would open it.
prop organism tint.color=#8a3ac0
prop organism tint.amount=0.7
prop glowgrowth tint.color=#60ff70
prop glowgrowth tint.amount=0.8
prop glowgrowth beh.hidden=1
prop embers beh.hidden=1
prop coreburnnote beh.hidden=1
prop coreopennote beh.hidden=1
prop heartseed beh.hidden=1
prop teodortape obj.name=teodortape
prop teodortape beh.hidden=1
