prop domeair atmo.fog=#6a5080
prop domeair atmo.fogAmount=0.12
prop domeair atmo.light=#f0e0ff
prop domeair atmo.lightAmount=0.2
prop domeair atmo.particles=fireflies
prop domeair zone.radius=14

prop coreburn obj.name=coreburn
prop coreburn beh.use=Turn the core valve to BURN
prop coreburn if.use=signal|mother\nhas|story:rootlit|1\n!has|story:spreadway|1\n!signal|core
prop coreburn on.use=signal||core\ngive||story:core*1\nshow|embers\nhide|organism\nshow|coreburnnote\nshow|heartseed\nshow|farewell\ncamera|domecam|oldroot|5|40\nmessage||Fire runs down the root. The purple coral blackens and crumbles. In the ash, one seed, still warm.
prop coreburn else.use=message||The valve will not turn. The Blightmother first, then the root's three shards back in place - and the Heart was set the other way, or the core is done.
prop coreopen obj.name=coreopen
prop coreopen beh.use=Turn the core valve to SPREAD
prop coreopen if.use=signal|mother\nhas|story:rootlit|1\n!has|story:burnway|1\n!signal|core
prop coreopen on.use=signal||core\ngive||story:core*1\nshow|glowgrowth\nshow|coreopennote\nshow|heartseed\nshow|farewell\ncamera|domecam|oldroot|5|40\nmessage||The core opens. The coral lights up green and climbs the walls. Out of the root drops one seed, warm as a hand.
prop coreopen else.use=message||The valve will not turn. The Blightmother first, then the root's three shards back in place - and the Heart was set the other way, or the core is done.
prop heartseed obj.name=heartseed
prop heartseed beh.use=Take the heart seed
prop heartseed on.use=give||story:heartseed*1\nhide|\nmessage||The Heart seed. Whatever Verdance becomes, it starts again from this.

note expedition Expedition sign | ROOTCORE - EXPEDITION 3\n\nThe cave mouth is behind this sign. The dome is hers now. Do not go in alone, and do not go in blind.\n\nOda's team lost their boat off the point. Their key went down with it, and their log is locked in the strongbox at their camp. Read what they learnt before you meet what they met.\n\nThe oldest root lies at the back of the dome. It was here before any of us.\n\n- Aki, root gate (I came down after them. I did not go in either.)
note ringwave The Ringwave root | THE OLDEST ROOT\n\nCut deep into the wood: a ring of waves round a single line.\n\nThe same sign as the sea people's doors. It was here before the Seedkeepers - before the trees.
note teodortape Teodor's last tape | TAPE - T. LIND - LAST\n\n(Breathing. Then the voice, close to the microphone.)\n\nIf you are hearing this, the root is awake and you came the whole way. Good. I owe you the truth, so here it is.\n\nThe skiff on Pollenreach was mine. I wrote its log. I ran it onto the sand and left the beacon burning, because none of us could choose any more. Oda would burn everything to keep the land safe. Marit would hide on a balcony and let it decide for itself. I made V-1; I cannot be trusted with the answer. So I called for someone from the sea who owed Verdance nothing.\n\nEvery island you crossed, I crossed first. I left the doors open, the keys where you would find them, the notes where you would read them. Forgive me for that.\n\nThe valves are by the root. Whatever you turn, it is honest. That is all I wanted.\n\nTell Jonas the soup was good. Tell Oda I am sorry.\n\n(Click.)
note coreburnnote The core | THE CORE - BURNT\n\nThe organism is ash. Verdance will grow back slowly, from seeds, the old way. The network is gone; the land is safe.\n\nTeodor: his V-1 burns with it. He asked for honesty and got it.\nMarit: comes down off the top balcony at last, counting the steps out loud.\nOda: carries the ash to the shore, and does not cry until the boat is out of sight.\nJonas: makes soup for everyone, and for once nobody says no.\nBurr: rings his bell at the smoke until somebody scratches his ears.
note coreopennote The core | THE CORE - OPEN\n\nThe organism is loose on the wind. Every coast it reaches will green - or be eaten. The network is the world now.\n\nTeodor: his V-1 goes out across the sea. He asked for honesty and got it.\nMarit: stays on the top balcony, the first to see the green reach the next island.\nOda: plants her last tree on the meadow and stays to watch which way it grows.\nJonas: moves his bees to the dome. They have never been so busy.\nBurr: eats the first new shoot, which seems fair.
note farewell Oda Fenn's farewell | To whoever finished it -\n\nI did go in, in the end. Not far: far enough to see Teodor's light at the back, and to know he had already said everything he meant to say to someone else. To you.\n\nI have his tape. I have Jonas's pot, still warm somehow. I have Burr, who rang the whole way back.\n\nNow I am going up to the top balcony of the Heart, where my sister has been counting balconies for a month, waiting for me to come back with an answer. I will tell her the answer was yours.\n\nKeep the seed. Plant it somewhere the sea cannot reach. Whatever we did to Verdance, the next garden is yours.\n\n- Oda Fenn
note mushroomring Mushroom ring | A ring of pale cave mushrooms by the dome's wall - and in it a shard of green wood, warm.
loot mushroomring CaveMushroom*4;story:shard*1
prop mushroomring loot.refill=0

prop mouthzone zone.id=mouth
prop mouthzone zone.radius=4
prop mouthzone zone.message=The cave mouth. Warm green air breathes out of it.
prop domezone zone.id=dome
prop domezone zone.radius=4
prop domezone zone.message=The dome. Purple coral on the walls - and something big moving in the dark.
prop domezone on.enter=playsound||event:/amb/wreck_creaks|0.8|once|near\ncamera|domecam|blightmother|5|30
prop oldrootzone zone.id=old_root
prop oldrootzone zone.radius=3
prop oldrootzone zone.message=The oldest root. Two valves stand by it on posts.
prop odacamp zone.id=oda_camp
prop odacamp zone.radius=4
prop odacamp zone.message=Oda's camp. A cold fire and a sign.

# DEEP 10-24 settings
story expkey|Expedition key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The strongbox key of Expedition 3, from their sunk boat.
prop expbox obj.name=expbox
prop expbox beh.use=Open the expedition strongbox
prop expbox if.use=!signal|expbox\ntake|story:expkey|1
prop expbox on.use=signal||expbox\nshow|expchest\nmessage||The key turns. Inside: Expedition 3's log and their last supplies.
prop expbox else.use=message||Expedition 3's strongbox, locked. The mast box said the key stayed with the boat.
prop expchest obj.name=expchest
prop expchest beh.hidden=1
note expchest Expedition 3 log | EXPEDITION 3 - ROOTCORE - O. FENN\n\nDay 1. Landed on the point with Burr and the last of the bees' honey. Mast up on the crag.\nDay 4. The dome breathes. Something big sleeps in it, and small ones guard her. Fire keeps them back; I have set baskets along the walls.\nDay 6. Teodor's boot prints go in. None come out.\nDay 9. The boat broke its line in the night. I am staying. Marit is waiting on the top balcony of the Heart and I promised her I would come up with an answer.\n\nWhoever reads this: the brood tears shards out of the oldest root and carries them off. The root will not wake without them. Go into the dome.
loot expchest TitaniumOre*1;Battery*1;Rope*2
prop expchest loot.refill=0
quest title=The Core
quest intro=The Rootcore, under the Heart. Make for the crag with the snapped mast, then find the cave mouth in the hill.
step reach|mouth|1|Go to the cave mouth
step read|Expedition sign|1|Read Aki's expedition sign in the meadow
step collect|story:expkey|1|Dive to the expedition boat off the point and open the skipper's drawer
step read|Expedition 3 log|1|Open the expedition strongbox at their camp and read the log
step reach|dome|1|Go into the dome
step kill|Warthog|3|Drive off the Blightmother's brood
step kill|Mama bear|1|Defeat the Blightmother
step reach|old_root|1|Go to the oldest root
step read|The Ringwave root|1|Read the Ringwave root
step collect|story:shard|3|Find the three heart shards the brood carried off
step collect|story:rootlit|1|Set the shards into the oldest root
step read|Teodor's last tape|1|Read what was hidden behind the coral wall
step collect|story:core|1|Turn the core valve the way the Heart was set
step read|The core|1|Read what the core became
step collect|story:heartseed|1|Take the heart seed
step reach|oda_camp|1|Go to Oda's camp by the meadow, where Burr waits
step read|Oda Fenn's farewell|1|Read Oda Fenn's farewell
quest done=The Last Green World is finished. Verdance keeps one seed - and so do you.
quest reward=TitaniumOre*2;Seed_Flower_Yellow*2

# names for the show/hide actions (actions find objects by obj.name)
prop coreburnnote obj.name=coreburnnote
prop coreopennote obj.name=coreopennote
prop embers obj.name=embers
prop farewell obj.name=farewell
prop glowgrowth obj.name=glowgrowth
prop organism obj.name=organism
# RESIZE 10-24 retest: the bigger island's generator rocks that floated over slopes (ground check)
clear at -12.51 6.44 r=1.5 only=SmallBoulder
clear at 2.10 74.59 r=1.5 only=SmallBoulder
clear at -11.65 -6.82 r=1.5 only=SmallBoulder
clear at 28.12 39.72 r=1.5 only=BigBoulder
clear at -11.74 46.03 r=1.5 only=SmallBoulder
clear at -13.33 34.59 r=1.5 only=SmallBoulder

# (box agent 10-25: names for the guide pictures' snap points)
prop rcmast obj.name=rcmast
prop rcwreck obj.name=rcwreck
save The Rootcore
